--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The WhatsApp channel links the user's own WhatsApp account through Baileys
(https://github.com/WhiskeySockets/Baileys, npm package "baileys" 7.0.0-rc14),
Copyright (c) 2025 Rajeh Taher/WhiskeySockets, licensed under the MIT License
