full text accompanies the distribution. Baileys, jimp and their dependencies
are shipped unmodified under server/node_modules; each package's licence is
recorded in whatsapp-runtime-manifest.json.

Portions of the channel are adapted from Hermes Agent scripts/whatsapp-bridge,
Copyright (c) 2025 Nous Research (MIT, third_party/hermes-agent/LICENSE), and
from OpenClaw extensions/whatsapp, Copyright (c) 2026 OpenClaw Foundation
(MIT, third_party/openclaw/LICENSE).

