    https://www.blobstudio.xyz/ — packs BlobMascot, CircleMascot,
    CapsuleMascot, DropMascot, ConeMascot, PolygonMascot and StarMascot,
    Ferrox Labs' own artwork built with Blob Studio, 2026-09-18.
